WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Timeline and time blocking. An hour-by-hour day or week across all projects; drag tasks to plan your time.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: plan tomorrow; rebalance.

3
00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:11.330
Timeline: your week hour by hour, across every project.

4
00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.150
Switch to a single day.

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.360
Drag a block to a new time…

6
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.560
…stretch it to change its length…

7
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:22.130
…or drag an unscheduled task onto the grid.

8
00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:28.130
A task isn't on the grid: It has no due time; it's in To schedule (or the all-day strip if it has a date).

9
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:32.630
Day and week grids
